{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116832","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116832/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116832/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116832/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116832","id":3998362497,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7uUiuB","number":116832,"title":"Particles with Animation aren't aligned to emission shape","user":{"login":"Braveo","id":23423003,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDIzMDAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23423003?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo","html_url":"https://github.com/Braveo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-27T00:04:29Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T09:26:46Z","closed_at":"2026-02-27T00:07:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.1.stable, 4.6.stable, 4.5.1.stable\n- Not reproducible in 4.4.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot 4.6.1.stable - DirectX12 (Mobile) - NVIDIA RTX 5070 TI 16 GB\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhenever you have a particle with animation and an emission shape, the emission seems to extend that amount by however much the emission shape's length is. For example, if there's a 1x4 texture sheet used as a CanvasItemMaterial Particles Animation shader, extending the box to a certain size will extend the particle emission 4 times that amount.\n\nHere's a video demonstrating the bug:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/226fc12a-a72c-4a36-91fd-50e51e2fadb8\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create an empty Node2D scene\n2. Create a GPUParticles2D\n3. Create a CanvasItemMaterial in material, give it a particles animation with a certain Particles Anim H Frames or V Frames (you don't need a texture for this, but it is optional!)\n4. Create a process material in the particle system, set the emission shape to box, and extend the emission shape scale to a big number\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[gd4-bug-animparticles-2d.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25589911/gd4-bug-animparticles-2d.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Braveo","id":23423003,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDIzMDAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23423003?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo","html_url":"https://github.com/Braveo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braveo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/use